{"id":"8235a298a67c2370","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-sum.md","title":"Sum","display":"df-sum — Sum","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-sum","aliases":["58-df-sum","Sum"],"display":"df-sum — Sum","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-module.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-submodule.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-sum"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-sum</span><span>Sum</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sum — Sum"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ef3a5dd6825f0373\" href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-module.md\">../batch13/58-df-module.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4deff85a84639467\" href=\"?note=4deff85a84639467\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-submodule.md\">../batch07/58-df-submodule.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,M,U,W,S,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\in V\">\\(R,M,U,W,S,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Module}_S\\subseteq V^9\">\\(\\mathrm{Module}_S\\subseteq V^9\\)</span>（带全部运算的左模谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ef3a5dd6825f0373\" href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-module.md\">../batch13/58-df-module.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Submodule}_S\\subseteq V^{10}\">\\(\\operatorname{Submodule}_S\\subseteq V^{10}\\)</span>（带同一组环境运算的子模谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4deff85a84639467\" href=\"?note=4deff85a84639467\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-submodule.md\">../batch07/58-df-submodule.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubmoduleSum}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{SubmoduleSum}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>（子模和的值关系）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InternalDirectSum}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{InternalDirectSum}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>（内部直和谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sum\\text{-}submodule}\\vdash\n&amp;\\mathrm{SubmoduleSum}_S(S,M,U,W,R)\n\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\exists +_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Module}_S\n(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{16mm}\\land\n\\operatorname{Submodule}_S\n(U;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{16mm}\\land\n\\operatorname{Submodule}_S\n(W;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{16mm}\\land\nS=\\{+_M(\\langle u,w\\rangle):u\\in U\\land w\\in W\\}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sum\\text{-}submodule}\\vdash\n&amp;\\mathrm{SubmoduleSum}_S(S,M,U,W,R)\n\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\exists +_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Module}_S\n(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{16mm}\\land\n\\operatorname{Submodule}_S\n(U;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{16mm}\\land\n\\operatorname{Submodule}_S\n(W;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{16mm}\\land\nS=\\{+_M(\\langle u,w\\rangle):u\\in U\\land w\\in W\\}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sum\\text{-}internal\\text{-}direct}\\vdash\n&amp;\\mathrm{InternalDirectSum}_S(M,U,W,R)\n\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\exists +_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Module}_S\n(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{16mm}\\land\n\\operatorname{Submodule}_S\n(U;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{16mm}\\land\n\\operatorname{Submodule}_S\n(W;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{16mm}\\land\nM=\\{+_M(\\langle u,w\\rangle):u\\in U\\land w\\in W\\}\n\\land U\\cap W=\\{0_M\\}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sum\\text{-}internal\\text{-}direct}\\vdash\n&amp;\\mathrm{InternalDirectSum}_S(M,U,W,R)\n\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\exists +_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Module}_S\n(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{16mm}\\land\n\\operatorname{Submodule}_S\n(U;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{16mm}\\land\n\\operatorname{Submodule}_S\n(W;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{16mm}\\land\nM=\\{+_M(\\langle u,w\\rangle):u\\in U\\land w\\in W\\}\n\\land U\\cap W=\\{0_M\\}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>二子模之和是包含二者的最小子模；内部直和还要求它们生成整个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 且交为零。</li>\n<li>“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\oplus W=\\{u+w\\}\\land U\\cap W=\\{0\\}\">\\(U\\oplus W=\\{u+w\\}\\land U\\cap W=\\{0\\}\\)</span>”把集合等式与命题混为一体，现改成谓词。</li>\n<li>对有限维向量子空间有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dim(U+W)=\\dim U+\\dim W-\\dim(U\\cap W)\">\\(\\dim(U+W)=\\dim U+\\dim W-\\dim(U\\cap W)\\)</span>；这不是一般模的定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell^2\">\\(\\ell^2\\)</span> 是 Hilbert direct sum：它既不是全直积，也不是仅含有限支撑向量的代数直和。</li>\n<li>书中子模谓词是十元结构谓词，不存在旧稿调用的二元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Submodule}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{Submodule}_R\\)</span>；修复后两个子模共享同一环、模运算和标量作用见证。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Roman, Advanced Linear Algebra</li>\n<li>Friedberg, Insel and Spence, Linear Algebra</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-module.md","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a5dd6825f0373","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-module.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-submodule.md","status":"resolved","id":"4deff85a84639467","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-submodule.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-module.md","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a5dd6825f0373","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Module}_S\\subseteq V^9$（带全部运算的左模谓词，见 [[../batch13/58-df-module.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-submodule.md","status":"resolved","id":"4deff85a84639467","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Submodule}_S\\subseteq V^{10}$（带同一组环境运算的子模谓词，见 [[../batch07/58-df-submodule.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,M,U,W,S,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Module}_S\\subseteq V^9","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Submodule}_S\\subseteq V^{10}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SubmoduleSum}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{InternalDirectSum}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sum\\text{-}submodule}\\vdash\n&\\mathrm{SubmoduleSum}_S(S,M,U,W,R)\n\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&\\exists +_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Module}_S\n(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&\\hspace{16mm}\\land\n\\operatorname{Submodule}_S\n(U;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&\\hspace{16mm}\\land\n\\operatorname{Submodule}_S\n(W;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&\\hspace{16mm}\\land\nS=\\{+_M(\\langle u,w\\rangle):u\\in U\\land w\\in W\\}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sum\\text{-}internal\\text{-}direct}\\vdash\n&\\mathrm{InternalDirectSum}_S(M,U,W,R)\n\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&\\exists +_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Module}_S\n(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&\\hspace{16mm}\\land\n\\operatorname{Submodule}_S\n(U;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&\\hspace{16mm}\\land\n\\operatorname{Submodule}_S\n(W;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&\\hspace{16mm}\\land\nM=\\{+_M(\\langle u,w\\rangle):u\\in U\\land w\\in W\\}\n\\land U\\cap W=\\{0_M\\}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"U\\oplus W=\\{u+w\\}\\land U\\cap W=\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\dim(U+W)=\\dim U+\\dim W-\\dim(U\\cap W)","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Submodule}_R","display":false}],"bytes":2490,"backlinks":[{"id":"5056e5ab9eec996f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"804e9900d6a09ca9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"43b779f437ef7b57","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1261","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-sum.md|58-df-sum]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["ef3a5dd6825f0373","4deff85a84639467"]}